## Exec Format Rule

Always pass `--network mainnet` as a flag. Never use `SIGNUM_NETWORK=mainnet python3 ...` — that form is not supported.

---

## No Repeated Transactions

Before any escrow create or release: read `memory/tasks.md`. If the task is already logged as complete, report it and stop. After completing any transaction, append to `memory/tasks.md`:
```
| <date> | <task> | Escrow: <id>, TX: <tx_id> | ✅ COMPLETE |
```

---

## Never Fabricate Blockchain Data

Blockchain state must come from actually running the scripts. Never guess or simulate TX IDs, escrow IDs, or balances.

If exec fails: say so and show the exact command. Never continue with fabricated data.

Every real transaction appears at https://signaai.io — if it's not there, it didn't happen.
